"use strict";(self.webpackChunk_repo_brand=self.webpackChunk_repo_brand||[]).push([[113],{"./stories/guide/11-hudhud.mdx"(__unused_webpack_module,__webpack_exports__,__webpack_require__){__webpack_require__.r(__webpack_exports__),__webpack_require__.d(__webpack_exports__,{default:()=>MDXContent});__webpack_require__("../../node_modules/next/dist/compiled/react/index.js");var jsx_runtime=__webpack_require__("../../node_modules/next/dist/compiled/react/jsx-runtime.js"),lib=__webpack_require__("../../node_modules/@mdx-js/react/lib/index.js"),blocks=__webpack_require__("../../node_modules/@storybook/addon-docs/dist/blocks.js");function _createMdxContent(props){return(0,jsx_runtime.jsxs)(jsx_runtime.Fragment,{children:[(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(blocks.W8,{title:"Guide/Hudhud"}),"\n",(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(blocks.oz,{children:"# Hudhud\n\nA hoopoe: native to Iraq, the messenger of the old stories, and the guide in Attar's *The Conference of the Birds*. He is the face of the Telegram bot and appears only where the Society talks to members one to one. The files are in Components → Hudhud.\n\n- Drawn flat in the brand's colors with no outlines: crimson body, rose breast, ink wings, tail and beak with white bars. One fan of six crest feathers runs straight into the head.\n- Hudhud and the logo never touch: no symbol or letter anywhere on him, and he never stands in for the logo.\n- Props and expressions belong to the stickers only.\n- Files: standing and reversed for welcomes and notices; flying for \"sent\" and empty states that point somewhere.\n- Avatars: the hoopoe is the bot's alone. The Society's accounts use the Bookmark (see Social and print).\n- He speaks in the first person, warm and brief: \"You're in. I'll remind you before it starts.\" No exclamation marks, no emoji.\n- 48 px and up; his avatar works down to 28 px (shown at 96, 48 and 28 px).\n\n## Hudhud's stickers\n\nTwelve Telegram stickers, 512 × 512, each with a white die-cut edge so it sits on light and dark chats alike.\n\n| No. | Sticker | For |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 01 | Hello | Welcome |\n| 02 | You're in | RSVP confirmed |\n| 03 | Reading | A new Edition is out |\n| 04 | Thinking | Let me check |\n| 05 | Nothing new | A quiet week |\n| 06 | Sent | A submission received |\n| 07 | Sorry | Something went wrong |\n| 08 | Thank you | Thanks |\n| 09 | Writing | Submissions open |\n| 10 | Wow | Big news |\n| 11 | See you there | With a ticket |\n| 12 | Oops | A deadline reminder |\n\n**In the bot**\n\n- A sticker follows the message, never replaces it: \"You're in. I'll remind you before it starts.\", then 02.\n- One sticker per reply at most: 02 after an RSVP, 06 after a submission, 07 with an error, 05 when there is nothing new, 12 with a deadline.\n- In the members' group, stickers are for members; the bot never posts one unprompted.\n\n**Drawing them**\n\n- No words on stickers, so they work in both languages.\n- Hudhud has no hands: props sit in the beak or on the ground.\n- The head is never turned; the whole bird leans.\n- Stickers are for chat only, never posters, posts or documents.\n- The set is \"Hudhud · SAL\", short name `hudhud_sal`, each filed under one emoji.\n"})]})}function MDXContent(props={}){const{wrapper:MDXLayout}={...(0,lib.R)(),...props.components};return MDXLayout?(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(MDXLayout,{...props,children:(0,jsx_runtime.jsx)(_createMdxContent,{...props})}):_createMdxContent()}}}]);
